        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Create unified messaging strategy to communicate platform's benefits effectively. Simplify narrative to: \"Get AI platform, deploy agents we’ve built for various businesses with proven impact.\"",
