              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Focus on developing user-friendly AI agent platform enabling hosting, building multiple agents for businesses. Platform acts as foundation layer, similar to DevOps foundation, where businesses can deploy, manage various AI agents. This includes application building, ML models, voice translation, video creation, among others.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
