              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Ensuring clear communication of platform's unique value proposition during sales discussions. Potential clients may find it difficult to grasp benefits without concrete examples.",
